The npm dependency tree of this package is EMPTY by design: every runtime
import is a Node.js builtin. The only external runtime dependency is the
ripgrep binary (`rg`, MIT / Unlicense, https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep),
invoked as a subprocess by the grep tool and never linked or vendored.
